# `api/mvnw.cmd` is a Windows batch script and needs CRLF endings when checked
# out, but it must be *stored* with LF: the Maven wrapper bump in #559 committed
# it with CRLF in the blob, which makes every clone configured with
# `core.autocrlf=input` report the file as modified forever, with no way to
# clean it. Declaring the conversion here fixes it for everyone.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
